  "body": "Simply the best and priced to sell - $587,000 - one careful owner since brand new!\r\n\r\nOur vendors have met the market and are ready to move on!\r\n\r\nPositioned as a desirable end unit on the top floor, this beautifully presented apartment offers exceptional natural light, privacy, and a sense of space that is hard to find. Owned by the same careful owner since new and maintained in great condition, this is effortless living at its best. This apartment is the perfect lock-up-and-leave option without compromise.\r\nThe open-plan living area feels light and airy year-round, enhanced by double glazing and excellent orientation to the sun.  Two generous bedrooms are well laid out, complemented by a tidy, modern bathroom, making this home ideal for owner-occupiers, downsizers, or investors alike.\r\n\r\nWhy you’ll love this apartment:-\r\n\r\n* End-unit position for added privacy and extra windows\r\n* Light, airy interiors with excellent natural light\r\n* A well sized balcony overlooks the park with a peak of the sea\r\n* Double glazed throughout for comfort and efficiency\r\n* Two well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n* One modern, well-maintained bathroom\r\n* Two car parks included\r\n* Nearby lift access to the ground floor\r\n* Immaculate condition - one owner since new\r\n\r\nSet within an attractive well-regarded complex. Located just a footstep to Hoyts cinema, gym, Coast Plaza, local amenities, transport links, beaches and the Hibiscus Coast laidback lifestyle\r\n\r\nOUR OWNERS ARE COMMITTED TO THEIR NEXT STAGE AND MOTIVATED TO SELL!",
